{
  "project": "MacOSCleaner",
  "backlog_name": "Problematic Apps Fixture Base",
  "category": "general_patterns",
  "description": "Общие паттерны leftover-файлов для любого приложения macOS 15+ (Sequoia). Учитывает современные API: System Extensions, App Sandbox, Group Containers, SIP, Gatekeeper, Notarization, Background Task Management, SMAppService.",
