  "edge_cases": [
    "Apps with custom installers (pkg) — оставляют receipt в /var/db/receipts/ и /var/db/dslocal/",
    "Sandboxed apps — данные в ~/Library/Containers/[bundleID], не всегда связаны напрямую с bundleID (may use container ID)",
    "Group Containers — shared между несколькими app от одного developer (e.g., UBF8T346G9.Office для Microsoft)",
    "System Extensions (dext) — требуют systemextensionsctl uninstall [teamID] [bundleID] для удаления (macOS 10.15+)",
    "Driver Extensions — new in macOS 15, require separate uninstall flow",
    "Kernel Extensions (kext) — deprecated но всё ещё используются, требуют kmutil unload -b [bundleID] + reboot (macOS 15+)",
    "Background processes — нужно убивать через Activity Monitor, killall, или launchctl unload ДЕЛЕТЕ",
    "Login Items — остаются в System Settings > General > Login Items (macOS 13+ API: SMAppService)",
    "Background Items (BGTaskScheduler) — macOS 13+, требуют отдельного удаления через API или System Settings",
    "Browser extensions — остаются в profile data браузера (Chrome: Extensions/, Firefox: extensions/)",
    "Spotlight importers — /Library/Spotlight/*.mdimporter, требуют mdimport -r для unregister",
    "Quick Look plugins — /Library/QuickLook/*.qlgenerator, требуют qlmanage -r для reload",
    "Finder extensions — /Library/Plug-ins/FinderExtensions, требуют перезапуска Finder",
    "Share extensions — ~/Library/ShareSheetExtensions, system-level integration",
    "Notification Center widgets — deprecated в macOS 11+, но may remain",
    "Today widgets — deprecated в macOS 11+",
    "SIP protected paths — /System, /usr/bin, /bin, /sbin, /var/db/dslocal — нельзя удалять даже с root",
    "ContainerManager — macOS 15+ защищает ~/Library/Containers/ некоторых apps, требует Full Disk Access",
    "TCC (Transparency, Consent, Control) — permissions остаются в ~/Library/Application Support/com.apple.TCC/TCC.db (SIP protected)",
    "Keychain items — passwords, certificates, keys остаются в Keychain, требуют security delete-keychain или Keychain Access",
    "Certificates — остаются в Keychain и System Roots, требуют sudo security delete-certificate",
    "Fonts — installed fonts остаются в ~/Library/Fonts или /Library/Fonts",
    "Color profiles — остаются in ~/Library/ColorSync/Profiles или /Library/ColorSync/Profiles",
    "Input methods — остаются в ~/Library/Input Methods или /Library/Input Methods",
    "Dictation — custom vocabularies в ~/Library/Speech/Recognizers/SpeechRecognitionCore/",
    "Accessibility permissions — остаются в TCC.db, требуют manual reset или tccutil reset",
    "Screen recording permissions — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset ScreenCapture",
    "Full disk access — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset All",
    "Developer tools permissions — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset DeveloperTools",
    "Automation permissions — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset AppleEvents",
    "Camera/microphone permissions — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset Camera|Microphone",
    "Location permissions — TCC.db, требуют tccutil reset LocationServices",
    "Contacts/calendar/reminders/photos permissions — TCC.db",
    "HomeKit permissions — TCC.db",
    "Bluetooth permissions — TCC.db (macOS 11+)",
    "Local network permissions — TCC.db (macOS 11+)",
    "Files and folders permissions — TCC.db (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Network Volumes, Removable Volumes)",
    "iCloud containers — ~/Library/Mobile Documents/ — shared между macOS и iOS apps",
    "CloudKit — ~/Library/Caches/CloudKit/ и ~/Library/Containers/[bundleID]/Data/Library/Caches/CloudKit/",
    "Core Data — persistent stores в ~/Library/Application Support/ или в Containers/",
    "App Groups — shared containers между app и extensions",
    "XPC services — helper XPC services в ~/Library/XPCServices/ или /Library/XPCServices/",
    "SUID binaries — apps may install SUID binaries в /usr/local/bin или /opt/homebrew/bin",
    "Set-UID — legacy apps may use set-uid binaries",
    "Cron jobs — user crontab или /etc/cron.d/ entries",
    "LaunchAgents в user domain — ~/Library/LaunchAgents/",
    "LaunchDaemons в system domain — /Library/LaunchDaemons/ (require sudo)",
    "at jobs — /usr/bin/atq для просмотра",
    "Periodic scripts — /etc/periodic/",
    "Log rotation — /etc/newsyslog.conf или /etc/asl.conf entries",
    "Firewall rules — /usr/libexec/ApplicationFirewall/socketfilterfw",
    "NetworkExtension VPN configs — /Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/NetworkInterfaces.plist",
    "PPP configs — /Library/Preferences/SystemConfiguration/preferences.plist",
    "Proxy settings — System Settings > Network > Advanced > Proxies",
    "DNS settings — /etc/resolv.conf (managed by VPN apps)",
    "Hosts file — /etc/hosts (modified by some apps)",
    "PF anchors — /etc/pf.anchors/ (modified by Little Snitch, etc.)",
    "Apache/Nginx configs — /etc/apache2/ или /usr/local/etc/nginx/ (dev tools)",
